{"frase":"Se o ganho real for da ordem do observado na validação sob a mesma subamostragem, a capacidade de detecção é provavelmente boa, mas não garantida. A estimativa vem de outro grupo de usuários (validação), e o par v2 × v1 não é nenhum dos dois pares de referência. A subamostragem imita só de forma aproximada as curtidas invisíveis do u1.test (§13), e a capacidade real no teste-2 pode ser diferente, inclusive menor. A simulação aproxima, não reproduz, o teste final: ela usa outros usuários, outro par de sistemas e outro método de IC.","nt":445,"pares":{"S0xS1":{"icNormalVsBootstrap":[{"bootstrap":[0.05869300935412937,0.09189125735455157],"normal":[0.05845238416290957,0.09164057309010054]},{"bootstrap":[0.047583319041697096,0.078233802693965],"normal":[0.04758530315049319,0.07835999109131074]},{"bootstrap":[0.056600400217413915,0.08764629986913543],"normal":[0.0569630665182549,0.0876455710068999]},{"bootstrap":[0.04458689241995083,0.07697797215236533],"normal":[0.04423978541677956,0.0770022469796166]},{"bootstrap":[0.06424489786193285,0.09863601714208806],"normal":[0.06399813617366024,0.097747148006008]},{"bootstrap":[0.04790871585560569,0.08012318663458032],"normal":[0.0478422601948342,0.0799270916515333]},{"bootstrap":[0.05415709217743745,0.08483825738445615],"normal":[0.053501589966963636,0.08493101853703372]},{"bootstrap":[0.06637266738111285,0.0989722737842418],"normal":[0.06604315678252029,0.09899646692966635]},{"bootstrap":[0.04850210366168835,0.0818910501766837],"normal":[0.04849985937628926,0.08193378914486915]},{"bootstrap":[0.05917542617924518,0.08968882921302741],"normal":[0.05882912672946791,0.08937357853022096]},{"bootstrap":[0.05307372384325,0.08790766480642644],"normal":[0.05248419741072248,0.0877456917598712]},{"bootstrap":[0.057182374816971734,0.09152784317050867],"normal":[0.05725312947555698,0.09115593523865585]},{"bootstrap":[0.048165168228312585,0.0791954695007587],"normal":[0.04763868868199106,0.07884560349889028]},{"bootstrap":[0.054822